<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Happy Birthday!</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css" />
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <h1>🎉 Happy Birthday Chinni! 🥳</h1>
    <p>Wishing you a day filled with love, laughter, and endless joy!</p>
    <p class="signature">With love, Shiva 💖</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
body {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffd6ec, #ffeaa7);
  font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
  height: 100vh;
}

.card {
  background: white;
  border-radius: 20px;
  box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
  padding: 40px;
  text-align: center;
  max-width: 400px;
}

h1 {
  color: #e84393;
}

p {
  font-size: 18px;
  color: #555;
}

.signature {
  margin-top: 20px;
  font-style: italic;
  color: #6c5ce7;
}
